  Source: https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core
  Base version used: v26.6.22

OneRing patch
  Adds SNI override support via the "onering:real:bug" serverName format.
  Distributed under the same license as Xray-core (MPL-2.0).

Nothing in this repository reproduces the full Xray-core source tree.
It contains only the OneRing patch and build scripts, which fetch the
official Xray-core release at build time.
